{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026S30ELh77Ka1792768853.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美股三大指數全線下跌，當中，道瓊斯工業平均指數跌幅較大，曾經急挫逾700點，跌幅約百分之1。</p><p></p><p>中東局勢持續緊張，國際油價上升，石油股向好，雪佛龍和埃克森美孚早段升逾百分之2。</p><p></p><p>科技股個別發展，晶片股上升，美光科技曾升約百分之3，SK海力士ADR預託證券升約百分之4。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:53:27.183296+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T14:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:38:15.584666+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:47:36.683759+00:00","content_hash":"6a35a0a0a612ffbcfca58f6df493409089ab70c76a0d00fc1e9b243510fdde84","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:53:27.183296+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}